Windows resources, embedded into webtabs.exe by build.rs.

The icons are generated from the approved artwork (assets/webtabs-macos.png) with
ImageMagick:

  magick assets/webtabs-macos.png -define icon:auto-resize=256,64,48,40,32,24,20,16 \
    assets/windows/webtabs.ico
  magick assets/webtabs-macos.png -resize 256x256 \
    \( -size 256x256 xc:none -fill '#e5484d' -stroke white -strokewidth 14 \
       -draw 'circle 196,60 196,8' \) -composite \
    -define icon:auto-resize=256,64,48,32,24,20,16 assets/windows/webtabs-unread.ico
